ising 0 4cm lateral to this lesion is a second ill defined REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 1cm indurated gray white mass which comes to 1 5cm of the anterior  posterior  and inferior margins  The mass comes to 1 8cm of the superior margin and greater than 2 0cm from the medial and lateral margins  The remaining cut surface shows focally gritty and nodular dense gray white fibrous tissue with no other discrete mass or lesion  Representative sections are submitted from medial to lateral as follows  A B  First indurated nodule to closest margin  C D  Dense fibrous tissue between the lesion and mass  with hemorrhagic area as D  E F  Mass to closest margin  G H  Hemorrhagic area  with hemorrhagic area to closest margin as H  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  sentinel node hot and blue  571  61  are 3 tan red lymph nodes with a moderate amount of attached tan yellow fibroadipose tissue  The lymph nodes range from REMOVED_DATE to 1 6cm in greatest dimension  The largest node is inked black and bisected  and the nodes are entirely submitted as I  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  additional lateral tissue  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm strip gray white to tan yellow fibroadipose tissue with no orientation  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal focally dense gray white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesion or other gross abnormality  The specimen is entirely submitted as J L  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin superior half  is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm strip of tan red fibroadipose tissue with no orientation which is serially sectioned to reveal focally dense gray white fibrous tissue with no discrete lesion or other gross abnormality  The specimen is entirely submitted as M P  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  final shaved margin inferior hal