cimen reveals a firm  tan  stellate mass  4 8 x REMOVED_DATE  x 2 4cm   with superficial invasion of the attached muscle  posteriorly   The  gross distances of the mass from the nearest resection margins are as follows   0 1cm posterior  abutting inferior  0 8cm superior  0 5cm medial  0 2cm  lateral  0 2cm anterior  skin   The remainder of the specimen consists  predominantly of lobulated yellow adipose tissue   Micro 1  tumor invading muscle and nearest posterior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 2  tumor and nearest inferior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 3  tumor and nearest superior margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 4  tumor and nearest lateral margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 5  nearest medial margin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 6  tumor and nearest anterior margin including skin  1 frag  RSS  Micro 7  additional representative tumor  1 frag  RSS  Micro 8  representative uninvolved tissue  1 frag  RSS  Part two  labeled   2  inferior shave margin right breast   consists of a  single fragment of soft tissue and muscle measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 4cm   Portions of the specimen have been inked by the surgeon in green and black   The uninked portion of the specimen contains a single suture  Sectioning  reveals a tan tumor involving adipose tissue and muscle  grossly approaching to  within 0 2cm of the nearest posterior  and 0 3cm of the nearest inferior  margins   Micro REMOVED_DATE  tumor and nearest inked margins  all tissue containing tumor  submitted   4 frags  RSS  pj  Reports to  CHRISTIAN  ROGER  L  M D   SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS  ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  SURGICAL MARGIN   report_end  , Unknown.
